{
  "_comment": "Look of Ajmashell's big popups (faza E ticket 13, ADR 0021): the one source of the roles, ranges, presets and defaults. Read by Look.qml (look.mjs) and look_settings.py; Theme Center gets them from look_settings.options(). Live file: ~/.local/state/ajmashell/look.json (written by Theme Center only). Changing defaults or adding a preset: ~/Projects/hyprland-lua-migration/docs/wyglady-ajmashella.md.",
  "roles": [
    "surface_container_lowest",
    "surface_container_low",
    "surface_container",
    "surface_container_high",
    "surface_container_highest",
    "on_primary_fixed",
    "on_primary_fixed_variant",
    "on_tertiary_fixed_variant",
    "primary",
    "primary_container",
    "secondary",
    "secondary_container",
    "tertiary",
    "tertiary_container"
  ],
  "alpha": { "min": 0.5, "max": 1, "step": 0.01 },
